<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.7500 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.7500 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.7500 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday after 75,6500 on Friday.</p>
